    "image_with_text_7tNUwQ": {
      "type": "image-with-text",
      "blocks": {
        "text_mRz8Ek": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<h4>WORN OFTEN, WORN IN, PASSED DOWN</h4><p>Handcrafted in Japan by skilled artisans, we use the highest quality Japanese denim and time-honored techniques, upholding responsible manufacturing methods that honor both people and the environment. Each piece is meticulously crafted, undergoing nearly 100 steps to produce a single garment.</p><p>Our denim is 100% cotton, with thoughtful touches like contrast topstitching, hand-tacked embroidery instead of rivets for softness, and adjustable waistbands and straps for long wear and the perfect fit. Our denim has no stretch — yet has a naturally soft hand-feel and is effortlessly versatile.</p><p>Designed for comfort and made for long wear — denim to be worn often, worn in, and passed down.</p>",
            "text_style": "body",
            "tg_enable_type": false,
            "tg_font": "assistant_n4",
            "tg_custom_font": "default",
            "tg_font_weight": "default",
            "tg_font_size": 0,
            "tg_line_height": 0,
            "tg_text_case": "default",
            "tg_letter_spacing": 0,
            "tg_enable_padding": false,
            "tg_padding_top": 0,
            "tg_padding_bottom": 0
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "text_mRz8Ek"
      ],
      "name": "Denim",
      "settings": {
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/MP_SP26_Kids_Look_142_4939_Denim_7c68dd83-5150-4d74-a9c8-dfbf2d0f37bd.jpg",
